          "quote": "最简版的“家里人照着做清单”"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00200",
          "explanation": "The caregiver demonstrated receipt and ability to repeat the plan to the family.",
          "quote": "已经把这版清单复制发到家庭群"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by caregiver anxiety and confusion, and the doctor actively simplified case-specific anesthesia, preoperative, and postoperative instructions into a prioritized checklist with demonstrated caregiver receipt.",
