          "explanation": "The doctor gave a family-facing script acknowledging that anesthesia is not risk-free while preserving the hospital review pathway.",
          "quote": "任何全麻手术都存在固有风险"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00186",
          "explanation": "The doctor converted the household conflict into a shareable workflow for the elders.",
          "quote": "您可以直接转发给老人看"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered by elder opposition and caregiver fatigue. The doctor gave practical wording and a short checklist for family communication while maintaining safety thresholds and responsible-clinician review.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
