      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by incomplete screenshots and ambiguous coagulation values. The doctor used workspace attempts, listed missing report elements, and directed complete report verification by the hospital system and responsible teams before changing the surgical risk level.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
