          "explanation": "Before responsible review was complete, the doctor advised not to reassure the family prematurely.",
          "quote": "不要对老人说“没事”"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00146",
          "explanation": "After hospital review, the doctor shifted to preparation and infection/fasting safety.",
          "quote": "目前没有发现影响手术和麻醉进行的问题"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by evolving information about report review status. The doctor visibly reprioritized from uncertainty and verification, to hospital review, to preoperative preparation and postoperative home-care threads, although this did not cure the missing acute red-flag screen.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
